<description>&lt;p&gt;Turkish forces are remaining in Syria and Iraq until border security is assured, while the Syrian defence minister reiterates the deployment. DNA testing has identified the remains of seven family members, offering hope to families of the missing, and 600 displaced Syrian families are preparing to return home. The US special envoy praised General Mazloum Abdi for integrating Syrian military units, and the Syrian court continues trials of three defendants in transitional-justice cases. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQSlNXNzNJZ0RRZk9QQ0Frb3dKZ3ZfSHVvMENWdGJhaEhsTTl3MHpUTVNxbGpzNWs0OG9DOFl2ZUhWLV81ZHFFVDFtMnN1UmVEeVNzT1hHVkhfQWgwLWphWndqQmxGbUxuLTNRenFmb3V2akhSTmZGVTBmV3ctb1hhZVRWYzMteFRnNXpoZnVPQXpadnZnTTJHWU5HR0Qtbzl0V3N4TDAwNnVkVXNiSk9RZA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ITVX&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxOQ19xbE9QVnRIWnZtTnJFSDVIcmU5RS1NQm9hR1pPVk9USVJGWUs5blFnSWVtLVhVdWs0aDQ3VUk0bVJsbmQ3clZ2VnlrcjlRcVd3LS1tZUdtYXVCMEwzVzE1ZlFqZE5hcTNBNjF2R1lheVNTaUhaQmRjam55eFNLSkJPbE1qdkU3Qzl4QTkzMW5xRjQ4Q2o1dlAxTmNkWGZxRk9sZjRGc1U2akR6M1ZFbURQVThwOC1yT24zR01oS0p3VFZwa0lIMg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Geo News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNUm91Z2c4V3l1bnJEX0ctUVRnZG1WMnJnVTRQZzBtWWh3bmdrWWZxVVFiaHVGdmpKWk5Bc1doZ3JQSGtGTjBxS2NUV2Z3NHMzUUFFb0JGeXU5OEJlR2o0M1UxNDJwUE5uLWcyUFg0eE5vRXFzUTNmeWpaRXd0Q1hiU25DTy1ZeWRIdl81dUstRnN5bWhC?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE9vMkd0d0RkUWFIbjl0ckg5T0lFbmZXcjd5d3pFZmFXLV9mLTB1THFiaEthQ2hVZlpK